{"comment_text": {"ja27:0.1": "", "ja27:0.2": "", "ja27:0.3": "", "ja27:0.4": "", "ja27:1.1": "A state elephant pines when his friend, a dog, goes missing. ", "ja27:1.2": "", "ja27:1.3": "", "ja27:1.4": "", "ja27:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja27:0.1": "<article id='ja27'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja27:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja27:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja27:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja27:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja27:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja27:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja27:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja27:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja27:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja27:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja27:0.3": "Kuruṅgavagga ", "ja27:0.4": "7. Abhiṇhajātaka ", "ja27:1.1": "“Nālaṁ kabaḷaṁ padātave, ", "ja27:1.2": "Na ca piṇḍaṁ na kuse na ghaṁsituṁ; ", "ja27:1.3": "Maññāmi abhiṇhadassanā, ", "ja27:1.4": "Nāgo snehamakāsi kukkure”ti. ", "ja27:2.1": "Abhiṇhajātakaṁ sattamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja27:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 27 ", "ja27:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja27:0.3": "The Four-horned Antelope ", "ja27:0.4": "Frequent: a past life story ", "ja27:1.1": "It’s not enough to give him a morsel, ", "ja27:1.2": "a bite, some grass, or a rubbing-down. ", "ja27:1.3": "I think by seeing the dog often, ", "ja27:1.4": "the elephant grew fond of him. ", "ja27:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja27:0.1": "", "ja27:0.2": "", "ja27:0.3": "", "ja27:0.4": "", "ja27:1.1": "", "ja27:1.2": "", "ja27:1.3": "", "ja27:1.4": "snehamakāsi → sinehamakāsi (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja27:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja27:0.1": "", "ja27:0.2": "", "ja27:0.3": "", "ja27:0.4": "", "ja27:1.1": "bj30.12, ms22J_58, msdiv27, pts-vp-pli1.190", "ja27:1.2": "", "ja27:1.3": "", "ja27:1.4": "", "ja27:2.1": "ms22J_59"}, "keys_order": ["ja27:0.1", "ja27:0.2", "ja27:0.3", "ja27:0.4", "ja27:1.1", "ja27:1.2", "ja27:1.3", "ja27:1.4", "ja27:2.1"]}